      "content": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Customize the docs site",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "id": "block-0001",
          "type": "anchor"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Give your docs their own colors, typography and proportions with one CSS file. The bundled site includes Light, Dark and System appearance settings. System follows the reader's device; an explicit choice stays in that browser for this site.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Add your theme",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Add a theme to ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lgtmd.config.json",
              "type": "code"
            },
            {
              "text": ":",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "{\n  \"flow\": { \"command\": [\"node\", \"docs/authoring/run.ts\"] },\n  \"theme\": { \"css\": \"docs/theme.css\" }\n}\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "language": "json",
          "type": "code_block"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The path resolves relative to the config file and must name a regular UTF-8 file. Create ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "docs/theme.css",
              "type": "code"
            },
            {
              "text": " with ordinary browser CSS:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ":root {\n  --lgtmd-accent: #6d28d9;\n  --lgtmd-accent-foreground: #ffffff;\n  --lgtmd-radius: 0.75rem;\n  --lgtmd-content-width: 52rem;\n}\n\n:root[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --lgtmd-accent: #c4b5fd;\n  --lgtmd-accent-foreground: #201039;\n}\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "language": "css",
          "type": "code_block"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The site loads your file after its default styles. No Tailwind setup or frontend build is required in your project. The bundled components use Tailwind internally; this file uses CSS values, not Tailwind directives or utility generation.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Choose the level of customization",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Start with the shared tokens. They apply consistently across navigation, articles and review controls:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
